  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/AAD578">Definition <span data-tag="AAD578">7.3.6.1</span>.</a>cell-like!map of $\infty $-topoi Let $p_{\ast }: \calX \rightarrow \calY $ be a geometric morphism of $\infty $-topoi. We will say that $p_{\ast }$ is <em>cell-like</em> if it is proper and if the right adjoint $p^{\ast }$ (which is well-defined up to equivalence) is fully faithful. </p>
